 "last_played": 1513680963, "avatar": "f9f98fcfb5904fa07c0ba1be15d1058296a3e1df"}, "language": "english", "review": "Today for the first time i try Warframe. I have play too many games until now but its the first one i see without any help or tips for the basic mechanics of the game. They dont want new playerrs or what....\nAnyway iam start open web pages  to start learn some basics.\nI finish my first mission and in second mission without game ask me anything i found myself in a group for the second mission. The game have public your instances by default. What about a question if i want to go with others anyway? \nWhat the hell we finish the mission in like 5 min top in a running mode and i return to my ship to actually check for the first time the mods and the upgrades for my items (without any tips ofc). \nI was reading the mods and i was in the process to upgrade my items when i saw a countdown in the down right corner\n6,5,4,3,2,1 and i was in the next mission with a public group... That is the time i press alt+f4. \nIn the history of games its the first time sending a player in a mission without  the player have any idea about it especially when he have upgrade menus open etc... \nThe game have nice graphics but believe me it is not enouph. \nWhy i spend hours of my life reading on the web pages and see videos so i can start play anyway... \nAll those is my opinion ofc. I wish fun to all those having fun in this game,", "timestamp_created": 1508107661, "timestamp_updated": 1508107661, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.275795578956604004", "comment_count": 12, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}